ence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"医学经理确认6MWD和NYHA应答率的终点分类归属","category":"decision_pending","gap_id":"gap_32_01","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"次要终点归类（疗效vs安全性）"},{"action":"确认是否需补充其他次要终点","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_32_02","missing_source_classes":["项目研究设计确认文件"],"target":"其他次要终点（如心衰住院、NT-proBNP绝对变化等）"}],"heading":"次要目的和次要终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的次要终点包括：第12周6分钟步行距离（6MWD）较基线的变化；第4周和第12周NYHA心功能分级应答率。安全性评估方面，收集治疗期间不良事件（TEAE）的发生率及严重程度，不良事件按CTCAE 5.0_nonTumorLab或MedDRA 27.0编码进行分级和分类；特别关注第0周、第4周和第12周的体位性低血压症状及收缩压变化。上述终点的评价时点与双盲治疗期访视安排对应，6MWD和NYHA分级应答率在第4周和第12周访视时采集，体位性低血压症状与收缩压变化在第0周、第4周和第12周访视时记录。","rationale":"6MWD、NYHA分级应答率及TEAE/体位性低血压内容来源于当前项目已确认研究事实中的安全性终点和特别关注不良事件条目。需医学经理确认：（1）6MWD和NYHA应答率在方案中应归类为次要疗效终点还是安全性终点；（2）是否需补充其他次要终点（如NT-proBNP绝对变化、心衰住院率等）；（3）CTCAE版本和MedDRA版本是否为最终确定版本。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9bed9903e9e5_6c2d16bb86e22f9a","section_number":"3.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:414107c932e9fe30366cb7da","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_65980afdba6889157dd2:r4:c63e0788740b2185","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260930164353_6ecdbe7d","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"恢复本章节正文与当前项目来源的证据绑定后重新核对。","category":"mapping_failed","gap_id":"gap:evidence-binding","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9bed9903e9e5_0edc3f168ac7c29d"}],"heading":"探索性目的和探索性终点","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节正文的当前项目直接来源"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本次输出未能把正文绑定到有效证据；需补充或重新绑定支持本章节的当前项目直接来源。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9bed9903e9e5_0edc3f168ac7c29d","section_number":"3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:414107c932e9fe30366cb7da","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_65980afdba6889157dd2:r4:c63e0788740b2185","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260930164353_6ecdbe7d","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_65980afdba6889157dd2:revision:4","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索设计","quote_sha256":"6b541f609b7dbe55eeebdf04f2def91dbe2a8f33b58d692f3d04a9bb87b739cf","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_65980afdba6889157dd2:r4:c63e0788740b2185","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_65980afdba6889157dd2:revision:4","quote":"SGC-R12低剂量组：SMOKE-r1-2口服sGC激动剂 2.5mg 每日一次；SGC-R12高剂量组：SMOKE-r1-2口服sGC激动剂 5mg 每日一次；安慰剂组：口服安慰剂 每日一次","quote_sha256":"24a6f1e9f69a8fe64ab61a81ee0681cd4c83e3d85ef3ce8586669704b59de7c8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_65980afdba6889157dd2:r4:c63e0788740b2185","span_id":"es_005"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_004","es_005"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索设计。研究共设三个治疗组：SGC-R12低剂量组（SMOKE-r1-2口服sGC激动剂2.5mg每日一次）、SGC-R12高剂量组（SMOKE-r1-2口服sGC激动剂5mg每日一次）和安慰剂组（口服安慰剂每日一次），三组按1:1:1比例随机分配。所有受试者在标准心衰药物治疗（GDMT）基础上接受研究药物或安慰剂，双盲治疗期持续12周。研究包含筛选期（最长14天）、双盲治疗期（12周）和安全性随访期（末次给药后14天）。治疗期访视安排为每4周一次（第4周、第8周、第12周），治疗结束访视与第12周访视合并，安全性随访访视安排在第14周。主要终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化，由中心实验室检测，访视窗为±7天。","rationale":"研究设计要素（随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心）、三组分配方案（2.5mg/5mg/安慰剂，1:1:1）、治疗周期（12周）、研究时期划分（筛选14天+治疗12周+随访14天）、访视策略（D-14至D-1、D0、W4、W8、W12、W14）及主要终点（NT-proBNP百分比变化，±7天访视窗）均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。需医学经理确认：（1）安全性随访期14天内的具体评估内容；（2）GDMT背景治疗的具体药物清单和稳定期要求是否需在本章节或入排标准章节详述。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9bed9903e9e5_7051a397f6a8b348","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:414107c932e9fe30366cb7da","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_65980afdba6889157dd2:r4:c63e0788740b2185","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260930164353_6ecdbe7d","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_9bed9903e9e5_7f4ae9b094d7207e:full-draft:414107c932e9fe30366cb7da","quote":"随机化；双盲；安慰剂对照；平行组；多中心","quote_sha256":"2390eec78cb63fbb744f4d0cd34ca9e3a52cae7420fe7f7e88f4c2d12a283514","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:414107c932e9fe30366cb7da","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_65980afdba6889157dd2:revision:4","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索设计","quote_sha256":"6b541f609b7dbe55eeebdf04f2def91dbe2a8f33b58d692f3d04a9bb87b739cf","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_65980afdba6889157dd2:r4:c63e0788740b2185","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_65980afdba6889157dd2:revision:4","quote":"SGC-R12低剂量组：SMOKE-r1-2口服sGC激动剂 2.5mg 每日一次；SGC-R12高剂量组：SMOKE-r1-2口服sGC激动剂 5mg 每日一次；安慰剂组：口服安慰剂 每日一次","quote_sha256":"24a6f1e9f69a8fe64ab61a81ee0681cd4c83e3d85ef3ce8586669704b59de7c8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_65980afdba6889157dd2:r4:c63e0788740b2185","span_id":"es_005"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_006","es_004","es_005"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[],"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机化、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心设计。随机化采用中央随机系统，受试者按1:1:1比例分配至SGC-R12低剂量组（2.5mg每日一次）、SGC-R12高剂量组（5mg每日一次）或安慰剂组（每日一次）。双盲指受试者和研究者均不知晓受试者所接受的治疗分配；安慰剂与试验药在外观、给药频次上一致，以维持盲态。研究在多个中心开展，各中心同步入组。所有受试者在标准心衰药物治疗基础上接受研究干预，双盲治疗期12周，末次给药后进入14天安全性随访期。","rationale":"总体设计要素（随机化、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心）来源于章节包中已确认的设计标签及项目研究事实中的总体研究设计描述。1:1:1分配、三组剂量、安慰剂外观一致性、12周治疗期和14天随访期来源于项目研究事实。需医学经理确认：（1）双盲的盲态范围是否仅限受试者和研究者，还是包括独立评价者、数据监查委员会等；（2）随机化方法（区组随机、分层因素等）的具体实施细节；（3）多中心数量及中心选择标准。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（总体设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9bed9903e9e5_74a82e9a29e19013","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:414107c932e9fe30366cb7da","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_65980afdba6889157dd2:r4:c63e0788740b2185","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"b1d31103bc85e83bb04f82c8a3dfafc7e1d996219fc228c16b7074442e3c9a4a","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_9bed9903e9e5_7f4ae9b094d7207e:full-draft:414107c932e9fe30366cb7da","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:414107c932e